The '''2027 Pokémon VGC Baltimore Regional Championships''' is a video game {{series|reg|Regional Championship}} tournament held in Baltimore, United States.

==Tournament Details==
===Format===
* Phase 1 - Swiss Bracket (X Rounds, X-2 or better advance to Day 2)
*Phase 2 - Swiss Bracket (Top 8 + Top 24 players with same record as 8th go into playoffs) + Single Elimination
**All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}.

